### The open core's words in English: the frame every signed-in page
### sits in (the sidebar), and the page for an address with nothing at
### it. Every message has a note above it: where it shows, who reads it,
### and what each variable holds.

## The sidebar

# The phone menu button's spoken name (it shows only an icon).
shell-menu = 菜单
# Sidebar link to the home page: what is due today. One word.
shell-today = 今天
# Sidebar link to the list of the person's decks.
shell-decks = 牌组
# Sidebar link to the study page (a verb as a section name: "Study").
shell-study = 学习
# Sidebar link to the statistics page.
shell-stats = 统计
# Sidebar heading over the account's links (users, settings).
shell-account = 帐户
# Sidebar link, admins only: the server's user accounts.
shell-users = 用户
# Sidebar link to the settings page.
shell-settings = 设置
# Sidebar link to the page that connects an AI assistant (ChatGPT,
# Claude...) to Flash.
shell-connect = 连接您的 AI
# Sidebar button that signs the person out.
shell-sign-out = 退出登录

## A page that does not exist

# Browser tab title of the not-found page.
notfound-title = 未找到 - Flash
# Heading of the not-found page.
notfound-heading = 找不到页面
# The not-found page's one line under its heading.
notfound-body = 该地址没有任何内容。
# Button on the not-found page back to the home page; also on the page
# for a link that no longer works.
notfound-home = 返回首页

## A link that no longer works (an email's link that expired or was used,
## an invite)

# Browser tab title of that page.
gone-title = 此链接不再有效 - Flash
# Its heading.
gone-heading = 此链接不再有效
# Its line under the heading, for a link from an email or an invite.
gone-link-body = 它已过期、已使用或已关闭。
